  "description": "Bring a cheerful retro-boho vibe to your creative projects with this Pastel Stripes & Polka Dots Seamless Pattern Bundle. Featuring hand-painted stripes, playful polka dots, botanical accents, abstract brush textures, and a soft palette of coral pink, mint green, buttery yellow, cream, and sage tones, this collection is perfect for modern crafting and design.\nIdeal for scrapbooking, sublimation, fabric printing, wrapping paper, invitations, planners, nursery décor, stationery, digital backgrounds, and seasonal crafts. The seamless patterns create a fresh, playful, and trendy aesthetic suitable for both personal and commercial projects.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 20 Individual JPEG Files\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeating Patterns\n➤ Commercial Use Friendly\nFeatures\n➤ Hand-painted stripe patterns\n➤ Playful polka dot backgrounds\n➤ Soft retro boho color palette\n➤ Botanical and abstract accents\n➤ Seamless repeating designs\n➤ Modern nursery and craft aesthetic\n➤ High-quality printable papers\n➤ Perfect for digital and print projects",
